onOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"How confident are you in your answer?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Not at all confident (completely guessing)"},"2":{"Display":"Slightly confident"},"3":{"Display":"Moderately confident"},"4":{"Display":"Very confident"},"5":{"Display":"Fully confident"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID85"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3Kjf1YX6WSudGEm","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID86","SecondaryAttribute":"How confident are you in your answer?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How confident are you in your answer?","DataExportTag":"Q86","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"How confident are you in your answer?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Not at all confident (completely guessing)"},"2":{"Display":"Slightly confident"},"3":{"Display":"Moderately confident"},"4":{"Display":"Very confident"},"5":{"Display":"Fully confident"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID86"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3Kjf1YX6WSudGEm","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID87","SecondaryAttribute":"To begin, please answer a few questions about yourself. All responses are anonymous and confident...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"To begin, please answer a few questions about yourself. All responses are anonymous and confidential.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q87","QuestionID":"QID87","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"To begin, please answer a few questions about yourself. All responses are anonymous and confident...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3Kjf1YX6WSudGEm","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID88","SecondaryAttribute":"Deepfake Detection Accuracy and Its Predictive Indicators Among Generation Z University Students...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Deepfake Detection Accuracy and Its Predictive Indicators Among Generation Z University Students in Metro Manila, Philippines <br>Anika Miro <br>MSc in Social Research Methods, Department of Methodology, London School of \nEconomics <br><br>Thank you for your interest in this study. This study investigates which indicators most strongly \npredict Generation Z university students' ability to accurately detect deepfake videos \u2014 AI-generated media designed to look and sound realistic. Drawing on Media Dependency Theory \nand the Digital Divide framework, the study examines a range of predictors including media \nliteracy, media dependency, social media usage patterns, trust in media, confidence, digital exposure, \nand socioeconomic status, among Filipino Gen Z university students in Metro Manila. By \nidentifying the most influential predictors of deepfake detection vulnerability, the study aims to \nprovide researchers and policymakers with the evidence needed to design targeted interventions \nthat address the specific areas where this population is most at risk from the harmful effects of \ndigital misinformation.<br><br>What will my involvement be? <br>If you agree to take part, you will be asked to watch a series of short videos \u2014 a mix of real and deepfake videos \u2014 \nand indicate whether each video is real or fake, along with how confident you are in your \nanswer. You will also complete a set of questions about your social media habits, media \nconsumption patterns, and background including your gender, university attending, age, year level, and parental occupation. \nThe survey should take approximately 20-30 minutes of your time. Participation is voluntary. You \ncan stop completing the survey at any point if you wish to. Since the data collection is \nanonymous, it will not be possible to withdraw the information you have provided once you have \ncompleted and submitted the survey. <br><br>Will I be compensated for taking part? <br>As a token of appreciation for your time, 200 respondents will be randomly selected to receive a \u20b1200 GCash e-voucher each. Entry into this prize draw is entirely voluntary and separate from the survey itself. <b>Only participants who complete the survey by 20 July 2026 (11:59pm) will be eligible for the draw.<\/b> At the end of the survey, you will be given the option to provide your contact details through a separate form to enter the draw. Your contact details will not be linked to your survey responses in any way, will be used solely to contact winners and send prizes, and will be securely deleted once the prizes have been given out.&nbsp;Winners will be drawn after the survey closes, and prizes will be given out within two weeks of the draw to provide ample time for batch processing of prizes.<br><br>What will my information be used for? <br>Your responses will be used in my Masters\u2019 dissertation. Your personal information will be kept \nsecurely and destroyed at the end of the study. Your IP address will not be collected during this \nsurvey. Your participation will be anonymous - your name will not be recorded or used in any \nreports or publications resulting from the study. The LSE Research Privacy Policy can be found \nonline. \nYour data will not be processed using Generative AI tools, and no personal data will be shared \nwith third-party systems or used to train AI models. Analysis will be conducted using standard \nstatistical software.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Consent","QuestionID":"QID88","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Deepfake Detection Accuracy and Its Predictive Indicators Among Generation Z University Students...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3Kjf1YX6WSudGEm","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID89","SecondaryAttribute":"Please tick all 3 boxes to confirm your agreement before proceeding:","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please tick all 3 boxes to confirm your agreement before proceeding:","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q89","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"MAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please tick all 3 boxes to confirm your agreement before proceeding:","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I have read and understood the explanations above."},"2":{"Display":"I am aged 18-29 and currently enrolled as a student at a university in Metro Manila, Philippines."},"3":{"Display":"I agree to take part."}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"MinChoices","MinChoices":"3"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID89"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3Kjf1YX6WSudGEm","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID9","SecondaryAttribute":"How much do you rely on social media to take your mind off of everyday stress?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How much do you rely on social media to take your mind off of everyday stress?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"DEP3","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"How much do you rely on social media to take yo